    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλό-κοτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of unusual nature</i> or
				<i>form, strange, portentous</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
